{"id":47302,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-do-porto-2\/"},"modified":"2026-09-29T11:00:45","modified_gmt":"2026-09-29T10:00:45","slug":"maratona-porto","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-porto\/","title":{"rendered":"EDP Maratona do Porto 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">EDP Maratona do Porto 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>EDP Maratona do Porto 2026<\/strong> (20\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>8 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), com partida \u00e0s <strong>08:00<\/strong> no <strong>Queim\u00f3dromo \/ Estrada da Circunvala\u00e7\u00e3o<\/strong>, na cidade do <strong>Porto<\/strong>. Reconhecida internacionalmente com a chancela World Athletics Label Road Race, a maratona invicta atrai milhares de atletas de todo o mundo num percurso plano e r\u00e1pido banhado pelas margens do Rio Douro e pelo Oceano Atl\u00e2ntico.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo engloba a m\u00edtica <strong>Maratona de 42,195 km<\/strong> (com tempo limite de 6 horas), a veloz prova <strong>EDP 10k<\/strong> e a caminhada solid\u00e1ria <strong>Mimosa APO 6K<\/strong>. Com partida conjunta \u00e0s 08:00, os atletas beneficiam de abastecimentos regulares, pacemakers de refer\u00eancia, guarda-roupa, medalha finisher e grande anima\u00e7\u00e3o ao longo das art\u00e9rias do Porto e Matosinhos.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 da responsabilidade da <strong>Runporto<\/strong>, contando com o apoio institucional das <strong>C\u00e2maras Municipais do Porto e de Matosinhos<\/strong> e a homologa\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica da Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Atletismo e AIMS.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"col