>\ud83d\udcc5 8 de Novembro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 31 de Agosto:<\/strong> 18.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (31\/08\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 30 de Outubro:<\/strong> 20.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (30\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">\u00daltima Hora (EXPO):<\/strong> 25.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (08\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Mimosa APO 6K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 8 de Novembro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 31 de Agosto:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (31\/08\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 30 de Outubro:<\/strong> 13.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (30\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">\u00daltima Hora (EXPO):<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (08\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a EDP Maratona do Porto 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no domingo, 8 de novembro de 2026, com partida marcada para as 08:00 no Queim\u00f3dromo (Estrada da Circunvala\u00e7\u00e3o), na cidade do Porto.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as provas dispon\u00edveis no evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento integra a Maratona de 42,195 km, a corrida cronometrada EDP 10k de 10 km e a caminhada e corrida de conv\u00edvio Mimosa APO 6K de 6 km, todas com partida \u00e0s 08:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite da prova de Maratona?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A EDP Maratona de 42,195 km tem uma dura\u00e7\u00e3o m\u00e1xima de 6 horas, enquanto a prova de 10 km e a caminhada t\u00eam tempo limite de 2 horas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as fases e valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A maratona variou por fases desde 42,50 \u20ac no Natal at\u00e9 80,00 \u20ac (outubro) e 100,00 \u20ac na EXPO. A prova de 10 km varia entre 18,00 \u20ac e 25,00 \u20ac, e a caminhada entre 10,00 \u20ac e 15,00 \u20ac.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando \u00e9 efetuado o levantamento do dorsal?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os kits de atleta s\u00e3o entregues exclusivamente no Centro de Congressos da Alf\u00e2ndega do Porto, nos dias 6 e 7 de novembro, entre as 10h00 e as 19h00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"EDP Maratona do Porto 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-08\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Queim\u00f3dromo \/ Estrada da Circunvala\u00e7\u00e3o, Porto\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Porto\", \"addressRegion\": \"Porto\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a EDP Maratona do Porto 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no domingo, 8 de novembro de 2026, com partida marcada para as 08:00 no Queim\u00f3dromo (Estrada da Circunvala\u00e7\u00e3o), na cidade do Porto.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as provas dispon\u00edveis no evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento integra a Maratona de 42,195 km, a corrida cronometrada EDP 10k de 10 km e a caminhada e corrida de conv\u00edvio Mimosa APO 6K de 6 km, todas com partida \u00e0s 08:00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite da prova de Maratona?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A EDP Maratona de 42,195 km tem uma dura\u00e7\u00e3o m\u00e1xima de 6 horas, enquanto a prova de 10 km e a caminhada t\u00eam tempo limite de 2 horas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as fases e valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A maratona variou por fases desde 42,50 \u20ac no Natal at\u00e9 80,00 \u20ac (outubro) e 100,00 \u20ac na EXPO. A prova de 10 km varia entre 18,00 \u20ac e 25,00 \u20ac, e a caminhada entre 10,00 \u20ac e 15,00 \u20ac.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando \u00e9 efetuado o levantamento do dorsal?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os kits de atleta s\u00e3o entregues exclusivamente no Centro de Congressos da Alf\u00e2ndega do Porto, nos dias 6 e 7 de novembro, entre as 10h00 e as 19h00.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":68989,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28,478,31],"event_type_2":[24,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[811],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-47302","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-porto","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-maratona","event_type_2-porto","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_4-solidaria-sim"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-maratona-porto.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/47302","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\